  "description": "A guild for the bold and unconventional! Join Mismatched Akumas if you&#039;re ready to shake things up in the world of idle MMOs. We&#039;re a community of misfits united by our love for strategy, adventure, and a dash of chaos. Active participation is key - if you&#039;re not ready to roll up your sleeves and get involved, you&#039;re better off elsewhere. Members who go MIA will be kicked out, so make sure you&#039;re committed to the cause!\n\n*Requirements:*\n\n- Active participation in guild activities and discussions\n- Willingness to collaborate and contribute to guild goals\n- A sense of humor and adaptability (things won&#039;t always go as planned!)\n\n*What we offer:*\n\n- A supportive community of like-minded players\n- Opportunities for collaboration and strategy-sharing\n- A fun and dynamic environment that&#039;s always evolving\n\nJoin us if you&#039;re ready to unleash your inner Akuma!",
